{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107015","id":2558052260,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6YeMek","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107015","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107015.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107015.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107015","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107015/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107015/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107015/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e521d69d395782a11a58bd897cf335a91104cb20","number":107015,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Texture format error on export: Show project setting","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Changing the project setting manually will prompt for a restart, which will trigger the required re-import of textures.\r\n\r\nPreviously the project setting would be changed automatically but textures would not be re-imported, which could be unexpected (would lead to exports with missing textures).\r\n\r\nNew behavior:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a32d852b-19b3-4c1f-a877-26671725faa1\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106992\r\n\r\nAdvantages over changing the setting automatically and showing a restart dialog:\r\n\r\n- Less magic, makes clear that there's a *Project* Setting and where it's located.\r\n- Allows the user to hover the project setting for more documentation.\r\n- The user could understand that they would probably want to turn the project setting back off if they ever decide to uncheck the checkbox in the export settings.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","ur